      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\ndocument_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for OCR and Layout Extraction\ndocument_field_extraction.py - Extract structured fields from OCR-normalized document text\ndocument_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for OCR and Layout Extraction\nextract_key_values.py - extracts key-value pairs from a form-like document\nextract_layout.py - extracts blocks, lines, tables, or layout elements from a document\nextract_tables.py - extracts table cells and row structure from a document\nextract_text.py - extracts plain text from a scanned document image\nocr_embedding.py - Embed extracted document sections for semantic retrieval\nocr_safety.py - Check extracted document text for unsafe content\nocr_translate.py - Translate extracted OCR text\n\nCreate extract_key_values.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts key-value pairs from a form-like document.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
