      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for extracting key-value pairs from a form-like document. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice for this task as it provides robust OCR and key-value pair extraction capabilities. I will use the Amazon Textract SDK to integrate with the service. </thinking>\n",
